---
// Built under its own gates — section 7 of the home-page skeleton (mt#3827).
// Honesty discipline is locked: do not market the unbuilt as built.
---

<section id="built" class="content-section" aria-labelledby="built-heading">
  <div class="content-inner">
    <p class="eyebrow">Built under its own gates</p>
    <h2 id="built-heading" class="section-headline">Its own first customer.</h2>
    <div class="section-body">
      <p>
        Every change to Minsky goes through Minsky: a task, an isolated session, a pre-commit
        hook, an independent review — before it merges. When one of those gates misses something,
        the fix is to tighten the gate, not to write a note asking the next agent to be more
        careful.
      </p>
      <p>Not every piece described above is finished. Honestly, as of this writing:</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="status-list">
      <li>
        <span class="status-label">Multi-agent coordination</span>
        <span class="status-tag partial">Partially built</span>
        <span class="status-note">— dependency tracking and dispatch work; broader
          cross-agent orchestration is still filling in.</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="status-label">The cockpit</span>
        <span class="status-tag partial">Partially built</span>
        <span class="status-note">— core surfaces are live; coverage across every workflow
          isn't complete yet.</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="status-label">Decision routing</span>
        <span class="status-tag early">Early</span>
        <span class="status-note">— the mechanism that pulls a person in only for genuinely
          hard calls exists, and is still being tuned.</span>
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p class="section-note">
      The CLI, sessions, and the hooks described above are running today. What isn't finished is
      named here rather than implied.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .content-section {
    padding: 4.5rem 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid color-mix(in oklch, var(--color-text-primary) 4%, transparent);
  }
  .content-inner {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .section-headline {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .section-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.125rem;
  }
  .section-body p {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 42rem;
  }

  .status-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.875rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .status-list li {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.5rem 0.625rem;
    padding: 0.875rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklch, var(--color-text-primary) 8%, transparent);
    border-radius: 6px;
    background-color: var(--color-bg-elevated);
  }
  .status-label {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }
  .status-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-eyebrow);
    letter-spacing: var(--text-eyebrow--letter-spacing);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 0.125rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }
  .status-tag.partial {
    color: var(--color-warn-amber);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklch, var(--color-warn-amber) 40%, transparent);
  }
  .status-tag.early {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklch, var(--color-text-primary) 16%, transparent);
  }
  .status-note {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    flex-basis: 100%;
  }

  .section-note {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-subtle);
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
